`volume_db` (I assume this is correct?).\" (Omit \"max_distance\" because it is drawn regardless).\r\n \r\n    - \"Attenuation Enabled\" phrasing could be confusing to some users because (despite being under the \"Visualization\" section) they might assume it affects the audio.\r\n\r\n4. In game: I would keep these as a debug aid only since it's an audio node. If a game dev wants particular visuals for the sounds that's up to them.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027817307/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027883533","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121471#issuecomment-5027883533","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121471","id":5027883533,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK69qDQ","user":{"login":"PavielKraskouski","id":9061796,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNjE3OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9061796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski","html_url":"https://github.com/PavielKraskouski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T22:27:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T22:37:31Z","body":"> * Change to \"Visualize/Draw/Display/Depict/Render(??) Attenuation\"\r\n\r\nShow Attenuation\r\n\r\nTooltip: \"If `true`, draws the sound's area of ​​effect using `max_distance` and `visualization_color`.\"","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027883533/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5028783380","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121471#issuecomment-5028783380","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121471","id":5028783380,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK70lFA","user":{"login":"Thiago-Weiss","id":137117035,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCw9aw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137117035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss","html_url":"https://github.com/Thiago-Weiss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T00:28:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T00:28:52Z","body":"> * Adding a new option to the Debug menu: I assume this would be discouraged. Maybe it could hook into the existing `Visible Collision Shapes` option.\r\n\r\nA new button is better because it allows the user to decide what they want to see. I didn't show it, but the button is already implemented in Debug > Visible Audio Visualization.\r\n\r\n> * Tooltip: \"If true, draw attenuation with `color` opacity representing a percentage of `volume_db` (I assume this is correct?).\" (Omit \"max_distance\" because it is drawn regardless).\r\n\r\nYes, it represents the volume, but takes `max_distance` and `attenuation` into account.\r\n\r\n> Show Attenuation\r\n\r\nDone\r\n\r\nNow I'm going to do the 3D.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5028783380/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5039128983","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121471#issuecomment-5039128983","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121471","id":5039128983,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLFsBlw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T21:15:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T21:15:56Z","body":"Thanks for opening a pull request :slightly_smiling_face: \r\n\r\nFeature pull requests should be associated to a *feature proposal* to justify the need for implementing the feature in Godot core. Please open a proposal on the [Godot proposals](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals) repository (and link to this pull request in the proposal's body).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5039128983/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5045179624","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121471#issuecomment-5045179624","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121471","id":5045179624,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLLdU6A","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-22T11:22:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T11:22:06Z","body":"Fair as a proof of concept or for its own addon.\r\n\r\nNot doing a judgement call here if this shall be eventually merged or not, but just to bring it to a technical level that it can be tech-approved here are a few things that need to all be considered when adding new engine-level debug.\r\n\r\n- Debug code needs to be excluded from no-debug builds and release builds.\r\n\r\n- Debug needs global toggles and settings both for ProjectSettings but also for Editor Viewport and runtime debug to keep the visual clutter added by the debug manageable.\r\n\r\n- Filled debug shapes in general create a lot of visual clutter and overlap fighting and regress rendering performance quickly so this needs to be highly optional.\r\n\r\n- Naming consistency.\r\nThis needs a check with existing, more modern debug, to follow the same naming pattern for related and similar debug properties and functions.\r\n\r\n- Canvas pairing\r\nIn 2D pairing it with the canvas item parent can make the debug get affected by some canvas properties and z-sorting which should not happen.\r\n\r\n- Draw performance.\r\nThe Node2D draw line and polyline functions are lowest end in terms of performance and should never be used for (new) engine debug if it can be avoided.\r\nUse a shared mesh as the geometry of the raw circle is always the same.\r\nUse mesh instances with instance transform for placement and scaling.\r\nThe bonus for using a mesh in 2d is that you can mostly reuse the same code for the 3d version.\r\n\r\n- Codestyle\r\nI see you copied SceneTree code for what the old debug for physics and stuff did which is fair, but this likely should all be controlled by properties and functions on the actual AudioServer. That the SceneTree is even involved with debug is very old legacy stuff that should not be copied or added to.\r\n\r\nThis may be by no means and extensive full list, just what immediately comes to mind.\r\nIf you consider working on all this I highly suggest that you join the related dev channels for quick questions.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5045179624/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5048238496","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121471#issuecomment-5048238496","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121471","id":5048238496,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLOYBoA","user":{"login":"Thiago-Weiss","id":137117035,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCw9aw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137117035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss","html_url":"https://github.com/Thiago-Weiss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-22T15:41:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T15:41:03Z","body":"> * Debug code needs to be excluded from no-debug builds and release builds.\r\n> * Debug needs global toggles and settings both for ProjectSettings but also for Editor Viewport and runtime debug to keep the visual clutter added by the debug manageable.\r\n\r\nI was looking at how the other debug features are implemented (Collision Shapes, Paths, Navigation, and Avoidance), and from what I could see, the Avoidance debug seems to be the one that best matches what you described. It doesn't use a `bool SceneTree::is_debugging_some_hint() const`; instead, it queries `NavigationServer2D::get_singleton()->get_debug_avoidance_enabled()` directly, and everything related to the debug is wrapped in:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n#ifdef DEBUG_ENABLED\r\n...\r\n#endif // DEBUG_ENABLED\r\n```\r\nShould I use this pattern?\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso, for future questions, should I use https://chat.godotengine.org/? (That's the most official development chat I could find.)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5048238496/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5049091985","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121471#issuecomment-5049091985","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121471","id":5049091985,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLPMHkQ","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-22T17:03:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T17:03:58Z","body":"The navigation debug is one of the more modernized examples. Likely a good choice to copy from (... because I did that debug, lol,  jk). It is still a little outdated on a few things that I never found time to do and improve but if you copy from it you likely end up mostly there. Yes to the dev chat that you linked, there are channels for editor and audio topics.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5049091985/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5065850692","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121471#issuecomment-5065850692","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121471","id":5065850692,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLfK_RA","user":{"login":"nahwar","id":10695768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjk1NzY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10695768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar","html_url":"https://github.com/nahwar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T03:28:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T03:30:51Z","body":"What a coincidence, i've been experimenting with a similar idea but using Gizmos instead, I don't think my approach is optimal, but being able to modify `max_distance `from the viewport is quite handy. \r\nHave you considered adding something like that, or is that beyond the scope of this PR?\r\n\r\nHere's how it looks for reference:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d31c1928-0d01-46ae-8e07-ead686d1a45d\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5065850692/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5065953470","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121471#issuecomment-5065953470","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121471","id":5065953470,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLfRQvg","user":{"login":"Thiago-Weiss","id":137117035,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCw9aw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137117035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss","html_url":"https://github.com/Thiago-Weiss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T03:50:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T03:50:16Z","body":"@nahwar \r\nThat’s a great idea, I hadn't thought of doing something like that (a gizmo to control `max_distance`). Let's combine the ideas, since they complement each other really well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5065953470/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5071197664","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121471#issuecomment-5071197664","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121471","id":5071197664,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLkRV4A","user":{"login":"nahwar","id":10695768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjk1NzY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10695768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar","html_url":"https://github.com/nahwar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nahwar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T14:53:11Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T14:53:11Z","body":"@Thiago-Weiss\r\nSounds good! In that case I'll make a PR focusing on improving the gizmo functionality of the audio nodes, and I'll leave the matter of attenuation visualization to you.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5071197664/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5075072569","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121471#issuecomment-5075072569","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121471","id":5075072569,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLn92OQ","user":{"login":"Thiago-Weiss","id":137117035,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCw9aw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137117035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss","html_url":"https://github.com/Thiago-Weiss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thiago-Weiss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T22:29:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T22:29:03Z","body":"@smix8 \r\nI have one question about the debug settings. Right now I have these properties on AudioStreamPlayer2D:\r\n```\r\n\tbool visualization_enabled = false;\r\n\tbool visualization_attenuation_enabled = false;\r\n\tColor visualization_color = Color(0.0, 0.5, 0.9, .42);\r\n```\r\nShould I remove them from the node and move them to global debug settings (under `Project > Project Settings > Debug > Shapes`), or should I keep them on the node and also expose them as global settings, using the global ones as default values like `CollisionShape2D` does?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5075072569/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5077838569","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121471#issuecomment-5077838569","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121471","id":5077838569,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLqmq6Q","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-25T09:00:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-25T09:00:57Z","body":"I would remove any per-Node customization and go with a single global setting for e.g. color and debug visual for everything.\r\n\r\nThe perceived convenience that per-Node customization brings is completely outweigh by all the code noise, long-term tech dept, and performance and scaling issues that it causes. It will create a high chance of rejection for this PR. I would not include it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5077838569/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]